    "text": "By Ayden Crowley ,\n1 hours ago JASPER, Ind. (WEHT) — The Jasper Wildcats suffer their first loss in nearly two weeks after an 11-0 loss to the Jeffersonville Red Devils.\nThe Wildcats look to bounce back on April 30 against the Central Bears.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Eyewitness News (WEHT/WTVW).",
